This product is a substantially modified derivative of CaD-Track:
https://github.com/joedanields/CaD-Track

CaD-Track was distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its license is
retained and its upstream provenance is recorded in this repository. The
derivative removes the browser/API, raster-image, OCR, and Tesseract paths and
replaces them with a vector-only desktop application, deterministic alignment
and matching, and mechanical-drawing inspection-relevance rules.

The three-stage matching design was also informed at a conceptual level by
CADMorph: https://github.com/Mirdula18/CADMorph. CADMorph did not contain a
license when reviewed on 2026-09-04; no CADMorph source code or model assets
are included here.
